  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Sector Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed assistance will enhance Bhutan&apos;s health system&apos;s overall performance. The proposal is aligned with priorities in the National Health Policy of the Ministry of Health (MOH) and will support the implementation of the upcoming Twelfth Five-Year Plan (2018-2022).  The program is included in Asian Development Bank (ADB)&apos;s Bhutan country operations business plan, 2016-2018,  and reinforces ADB&apos;s inclusive growth agenda in the Midterm Review of Strategy 2020.</narrative>
  </description>
